  "@type": "sc:Dataset",
  "name": "data/extracted/airport_role_claims.jsonl",
  "description": "AirportRoleClaim records extracted from data. One airline the notes name as using one airport in one role. Records to extract: one per airline named in each \"Hub for ...\" or \"Focus city for ...\" statement under an airport's `##` heading. Leave out everything else a section says: the desk's prose about an airport's size, location or connectivity names no airline role, and a section that names no hub or focus city yields no record.",
